Value List LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value List NEIGHBOR_ID (\S+)
Value List NEIGHBOR_PORT (\S+)
Value List NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Local Interface.* -> SkipHeader
  ^\s*---+.* -> SkipHeader

SkipHeader
  ^\s*---+.* -> SkipHeader
  ^\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_PORT}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}.* -> Record
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
